    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `submit_transcription.py` file that submits an audio file for batch transcription using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a provider and use its specific SDK or API. For this task, I will use the Amazon Transcribe service, which is a popular choice for batch transcription. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the `start_transcription_job` method to submit the audio file for transcription. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789854826795,
          "start": 1789854824486
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bba938260013599YxU7uFfs8b",
